5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Hello... I'm not really sure what to say first. I'll just... observe everyone for a while and try my best to help.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. I agree with Daisuke; since we have no information yet, the most rational approach is to observe each other's behavior and speech patterns.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"A very standard start. Let's see if anyone has the courage to be more interesting than ""observing,"" or if we're all just going to play it safe today.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not here to play it safe! I'll find the werewolf and protect everyone, no matter what. Let's just be honest and get this started!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Let's keep a level head. Takumi, your enthusiasm is noted, but honesty is difficult when roles are secret. I agree with Victoria; observing our patterns is the most logical first step.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think Victoria and Ryuji are right. It's probably better to be careful. I'll just listen to what everyone has to say... if that's okay.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, there is no need to be hesitant. Your caution is a valid perspective. I am simply interested in seeing how our dynamics evolve as the pressure increases.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"The dynamics are already quite predictable. We have the timid one, the analysts, and the hero. It's almost a cliché. I wonder who's actually hiding something behind these roles.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, stop acting like this is some kind of movie! I'm not playing a role, I'm just telling you I'm going to win. If you're so bored, why don't you actually try to help us?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, your cynicism doesn't provide any useful data. If you're looking for someone hiding something, perhaps you should focus on providing a constructive strategy instead of just critiquing our personalities.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't like it when people fight. Maybe we could all just try to be a bit kinder to each other? It might make it easier to trust one another... I think.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, while kindness is a virtue, trust in this game must be earned through consistency and logic, not just sentiment. We must remain objective if we wish to survive.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you're quite the pragmatist. But remember, ""objective"" logic can be the perfect camouflage for a werewolf. I'm just pointing out that the most ""rational"" person in the room is often the one with the most to hide.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just talking in circles to confuse us! If you're so smart, stop making everything a riddle and actually say something useful. I'm not letting some weird games get in the way of saving the village!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, your attempts to sow doubt without evidence are counterproductive. If you continue to prioritize riddles over results, you're only making yourself look suspicious. Let's focus on the facts we have, which currently are none.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll just skip for now. I'm still trying to process everything. I hope we can all get along tomorrow...,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"I shall also pass for now. We have established our initial positions, and further speculation without data is futile. I look forward to seeing who reveals themselves tomorrow.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll pass as well. It's been an amusing introduction, but I've seen enough for today. Let's see who the Seer decides to target and how the ""hero"" handles the first real crisis.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not afraid of any crisis! I'll be ready to protect everyone tomorrow. I'm done for today, but don't think I'll let the werewolf get away with anything!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will also pass. We have a clear picture of everyone's temperament now. I'll spend the night analyzing these interactions to see if any contradictions emerge tomorrow.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
