36,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... good morning. I... I have some information. I'm the Seer, and I checked Shunichi last night. He's... he's human. I hope this helps us a little bit.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, thank you for sharing your result so quickly. If we accept your claim as the Seer, we now have one confirmed human. However, we must consider if this is a genuine lead or a strategic move.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Confirmed human, huh? I must say, Daisuke, I'm impressed you found your voice so quickly just to clear my name. It's a bold move for someone so timid. I'll take the compliment for now.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Wait, Daisuke is the Seer? I can't believe it! But if he's telling the truth, then Shunichi is safe. That means the werewolf is one of the others! I'm going to find them!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, claiming the Seer role on the first day is a high-risk strategy. While it provides immediate direction, it also makes you a primary target. We should consider if this is a genuine attempt to help or a play to gain trust.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I know it's risky. I just thought it would be better to tell you all now so we don't waste time. I really want to help... please believe me.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, your desire to help is noted, but we must remain analytical. If you are the Seer, you've given us a starting point. If you are the werewolf, you've just secured Shunichi's trust. We need more evidence.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you're overthinking it. Whether Daisuke is a genuine Seer or a very clumsy werewolf, the result is the same: I'm the ""good guy"" for now. Why complicate a simple gift? Let's see who tries to discredit him.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, stop overthinking everything! Daisuke is just trying to help us, and he's too nervous to be a lying werewolf. I believe him! If Shunichi is human, then we just have to look at the rest of us!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, nervousness is not a reliable indicator of innocence; it can be a facade. If we blindly trust Daisuke, we risk being manipulated. We should observe how the others react to this claim before jumping to conclusions.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm not trying to manipulate anyone. I just... I can't stand the thought of us making a mistake. Please, if you don't believe me yet, that's okay... I'll just keep trying to be honest.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, I agree that we must be cautious. However, if Daisuke is the werewolf, he has effectively narrowed the suspect pool to three people, including himself. It is a gamble. I am curious to see if anyone else claims the Seer role.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you're always so curious. If no one else steps forward to claim the Seer role, then Daisuke's ""gamble"" becomes our only lead. It would be a shame to waste such a convenient piece of information just because we're afraid of being fooled.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Ryuji, you're just making things harder! Daisuke is terrified and still trying to help us. Why can't you just trust him for once? If he's the Seer, we're wasting time doubting him while the werewolf is laughing at us!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, trust is a luxury we cannot afford in this game. My goal is not to make things ""harder,"" but to ensure we don't execute an innocent villager based on a feeling. Logic must precede trust.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I understand why you're worried, Ryuji. I really do. I'll just... do my best to prove I'm telling the truth. If you can't trust me yet, I'll just keep trying to help everyone.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, your consistency is noted. Since no one else has claimed the Seer role, we must weigh the probability. If we trust you, the search narrows. I am inclined to follow your lead, provided no contradictions emerge.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"It seems the consensus is shifting toward trusting our timid friend. I'm perfectly happy to be the ""confirmed human"" in this scenario. Since we're all agreeing, who's the unlucky soul we're voting for?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not letting the werewolf win! If we trust Daisuke, then it's between Victoria, Ryuji, and me. Ryuji is being way too suspicious and trying to confuse us with ""logic."" I say we vote for Ryuji!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Victoria"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your accusation is based on emotion, not evidence. Being cautious and questioning a claim is the responsibility of a villager, not a sign of guilt. Voting for me simply because I disagree with you is an irrational decision.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
